dms-greeter (1:2.0.0db1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Packaging moved from the dux-greeter repository to dux-packaging.
  * Built from the prebuilt release binaries (UI embedded); the epoch is
    kept at 1 so upgrades from the dux-greeter-built packages keep working.

 -- Avenge Media <AvengeMedia.US@gmail.com>  Sat, 24 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000

dms-greeter (1:1.0.0db1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Greeter extracted from DankMaterialShell into the dank-greeter repository;
    the bash wrapper and /usr/share/quickshell/dms-greeter QML tree are
    replaced by a single Go binary with the Quickshell UI embedded.
  * Existing /etc/greetd/config.toml commands
    (dms-greeter --command COMPOSITOR) keep working unchanged.
  * Epoch 1 introduced: versions restarted at 1.0.0 below the old
    DMS-versioned 1.5.x package.

 -- Avenge Media <AvengeMedia.US@gmail.com>  Sat, 18 Jul 2026 00:00:00 +0000
